WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.000
Another Thing That Dr. Bright Isn’t&nbsp;
Allowed To Do At The SCP Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.360
Pretend that SCP-963 is a joy buzzer!

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:12.160
For those who aren’t in the know, SCP-963 is&nbsp;
the medallion that you’ll always find on Dr.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.960
Bright’s person - It’s an indestructible&nbsp;
vector for his essence, his very soul.

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:19.440
Anyone who touches it suffers&nbsp;
immediate brain death,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.720
and Dr. Bright’s consciousness&nbsp;
is transferred to their body.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:27.760
So, naturally, when Dr. Bright is feeling&nbsp;
mischievous, it’s not a very responsible prank to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:34.000
treat SCP-963 like a joy buzzer - Considering it&nbsp;
will kill its victims instantly. It’s like making&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:39.440
a whoopee cushion filled with nerve gas or a fake&nbsp;
stick of gum that’s actually plastic explosives.

